This software includes atomic scattering factor data provided by the
Center for X-Ray Optics (CXRO) at Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory.
Source: https://henke.lbl.gov/optical_constants/

These tabulated atomic scattering factors (Henke, Gullikson, Davis, At.
Data Nucl. Data Tables 54, 181 (1993)) are made publicly available by CXRO
for research use and are redistributed here unmodified, with attribution.

The anchor data files under euvsimulator/data/anchors are numerical values
digitised by the authors of this project from figures and tables of the
cited publications (Vesters 2017/2019, Yamamoto 2011, Anderson & Naulleau
2008, Brainard et al. (LBNL), Sekiguchi 2011); each file names its source.
